> > > ALC655: 0 -> external amplifier power down; 1 -> SPDIF IN
> > > ALC658: 0 -> SPDIF IN; 1 -> external amplifier power down
> > > 
> > > 
> > > Can please anybody include this into CVS.
> > 
> > The patch looks fine.
> > 
